<p>
    Practical examples showing the Accordion component configured with various parameters.
</p>

<p>The following example shows a typical usage with parameters being set at both design and runtime:</p>

<CodeBox CodeBlock="@BusySnippets.Busy_Indicator_Example" AriaLabel="Busy indicator example code block" />
